  - partTagOrName: M_CW 1
    titleText: 'Motors '
    descriptionText: Drone motors spin the propellers to generate thrust. In a quadcopter,
      motors rotate in clockwise (CW) and counterclockwise (CCW) directions to balance
      rotational forces.
    keyFunctionsText: 'Generate thrust to lift the drone.

      Control altitude
      and movement by changing motor speed.

      Balance torque using opposite
      rotation directions.

      Help the drone hover and maneuver.'
